    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cave Miner is a casual roguelite mining game that blends exploration, strategy, and progression. Play as a dwarf miner exploring the depths of a mysteriously ever-changing cave. Your objective is to reach the bottom and uncover its secret. In the end, you're a dwarf. You'll figure it out.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the cave</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The shifting nature of the cave makes every dive a different challenge. Dig through destructible terrain, mine valuable ores, and search for hidden ladders to descend.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Think your swing</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since every swing drains your stamina, you must strategize your actions wisely. Examine environmental clues, plan your path, and use your reliable scanner.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rest at camp</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Back at camp, spend the ores you've gathered to upgrade your equipment, survive longer, and dive deeper on your next run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated cave system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grid-based destructible terrain</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resource management and strategic decision-making</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgradable equipment</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A short adventure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cave Miner is designed to be a short, satisfying experience, offering replayability through procedural generation, thoughtful gameplay, and gradual progression.<strong></strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cave Miner is a casual roguelite mining game that blends exploration, strategy, and progression. Play as a dwarf miner exploring the depths of a mysteriously ever-changing cave. Your objective is to reach the bottom and uncover its secret. In the end, you're a dwarf. You'll figure it out.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the cave</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The shifting nature of the cave makes every dive a different challenge. Dig through destructible terrain, mine valuable ores, and search for hidden ladders to descend.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Think your swing</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since every swing drains your stamina, you must strategize your actions wisely. Examine environmental clues, plan your path, and use your reliable scanner.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rest at camp</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Back at camp, spend the ores you've gathered to upgrade your equipment, survive longer, and dive deeper on your next run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated cave system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grid-based destructible terrain</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resource management and strategic decision-making</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgradable equipment</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A short adventure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cave Miner is designed to be a short, satisfying experience, offering replayability through procedural generation, thoughtful gameplay, and gradual progression.<strong></strong></p>",
